# Files that belong in the repo but must never be served from eliavafar.co.il.
#
# Vercel serves this project as a static site, which means every file in the repo
# was reachable over the public web — verified: docs/ISSUES-LOG.md, CLAUDE.md,
# scripts/*.mjs and the CI workflows all returned 200. The issues log in particular
# is a written record of this site's security findings; publishing it is a gift to
# anyone poking at the forms.
#
# Anything listed here is excluded from the deployment upload only. It stays in git,
# stays on disk, and stays available to GitHub Actions (which checks out the repo
# rather than pulling from the deployment).
#
# Do NOT add lib/ here — api/notify-lead.js requires it at runtime, so excluding it
# from the upload would break the lead pipeline.

# Internal docs and agent instructions
docs/
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# Tooling — run locally or in CI, never in the browser
scripts/
.github/
check-rotation.js
fix-images.js

# Unminified sources. Pages load the .min versions; these are dead weight in prod.
js/main.js
css/style.css

# Logo option mockups. Internal review pages for the pending logo decision — no page
# links to them, but Vercel served them publicly all the same. Excluded from the
# upload rather than deleted, so they stay reviewable locally until a logo is chosen.
# Once the logo is final, delete the files and drop this block.
logos.html
logos-v2.html
logos-v3.html
logos-v4.html
logos-v5.html
logos-v6.html
logos-v7.html
logos-v8.html
logos-v9.html
logos-final.html
logo-options/

# Personal/business data that has no business being on a public web server
טלפונים/
